<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Wing Tiek stock suspended.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Wing Tiek stock suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in the stock of Malaysian industrial group Wing Tiek Holdings Bhd was suspended on Wednesday pending an announcement from the company, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Officials at the firm could not immediately be reached for comment.</p>
<p>Wing Tiek's stock closed at 6.00 ringgit a share on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 206 2323)</p>
